---- MODULE space_let__unassigned__plain ----
EXTENDS Integers
VARIABLES x, y
vars == <<x, y>>
Assign(a, b) == x = a /\ y = b
Same(a, b) == a = a /\ b = b
Init == LET v == 1 IN x = v /\ y = v
Next == x' = x

====

